<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible 2014</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoseewo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebbaluwa ya Pawulo Omutukuvu Eyookubiri eri Timoseewo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoseewo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ebbaluwa ya Pawulo Omutukuvu Eyookubiri eri</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoseewo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Nze, Pawulo, omutume wa Kristo Yesu olw’okwagala kwa Katonda, ng’okusuubiza bwe kuli okw’obulamu obuli mu Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>nkuwandiikira ggwe Timoseewo omwana wange omwagalwa, nga nkwagaliza ekisa n’okusaasirwa, n’emirembe ebiva eri Katonda Kitaffe, ne Kristo Yesu Mukama waffe.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwebaza n’Okugumya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Neebaza Katonda gwe mpeereza mu mwoyo omulungi nga bajjajjange bwe baakola, nga nkujjukira obutayosa mu kusaba kwange emisana n’ekiro. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Bwe nzijukira amaziga go ne neegomba okukulaba ndyoke nzijule essanyu. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Nzijukira okukkiriza kwo okw’amazima olubereberye okwali mu jjajjaawo Looyi ne mukadde wo Ewuniike; era nga nkakasiza ddala nga naawe okulina. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Kyenva nkujjukiza okuseesanga ekirabo kya Katonda ekiri mu ggwe kye yakuwa, bwe nakussaako emikono gyange. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Kubanga Mwoyo wa Katonda, gwe yatuwa tatufuula bati, wabula atuwa amaanyi, n’okwagala era n’okwegendereza.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Noolwekyo tokwatibwa nsonyi kwogera ku bya Mukama waffe, wadde ku nze omusibe we, wabula naawe bonaabona olw’Enjiri ng’oyambibwa amaanyi ga Katonda, <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>eyatulokola n’atuyita tubeere babe. Ekyo yakikola nga tasinziira ku bikolwa byaffe, wabula ng’asinziira mu kuyitibwa okutukuvu, si ng’ebikolwa byaffe bwe biri, naye olw’ekigendererwa kye ye, n’ekisa kye, kye yatukwatirwa ng’ayita mu Kristo Yesu okuva edda n’edda Lyonna. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Kaakano ekisa ekyo kyolesebbwa mu kulabika kw’Omulokozi waffe Kristo Yesu eyaggyawo okufa, n’aleeta obulamu obutazikirizibwa ng’ayita mu Njiri, <verse eid="2TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>gye nalonderwa okugisaasaanya, n’okuba omutume, era omuyigiriza, <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>era kyenva mbonaabona bwe ntyo. Kyokka sikwatibwa nsonyi, kubanga mmanyi gwe nakkiriza, era nkakasa nti ayinza okukuuma ekyo kye namuteresa okutuusa olunaku luli.<verse eid="2TI 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Gobereranga ebigambo ebireeta obulamu bye wawulira njogera, mu kukkiriza ne mu kwagala mu Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Ekintu ekirungi eky’omuwendo kye wateresebwa kikuumenga ng’oyambibwa Mwoyo Mutukuvu abeera mu ffe.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Kino okimanyi, ng’ab’omu Asiya bonna banjabulira, mu abo mwe muli Fugero ne Kerumogene.<verse eid="2TI 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Mukama akwatirwe ekisa ab’omu nnyumba ya Onesifolo, kubanga yambeesabeesa emirundi mingi era teyankwatirwa nsonyi kubanga ndi musibe; <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>bwe yatuuka e Ruumi, yafuba nnyo okunnoonya era n’anzuula. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Mukama amukwatirwe ekisa ku lunaku luli. Era gw’omanyi bulungi nnyo byonna bye yakola mu Efeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Omuserikale Omwesigwa owa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Noolwekyo mwana wange nywereranga mu kisa ekiri mu Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Ebyo bye wawulira nga njogera mu maaso g’abajulirwa abangi biyigirizenga abantu abeesigwa, abalisobola okubiyigiriza abalala. <verse eid="2TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Naawe bonaabonanga ng’omuserikale omulungi owa Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Tewali muserikale ng’ali ku lutalo eyeeyingiza mu mitawaana gy’abantu abaabulijjo, alyoke asiimibwe oyo eyamuwandiika. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Omuntu yenna eyeetaba mu mizannyo gy’empaka, taweebwa buwanguzi bw’atagoberera biragiro bya mizannyo egyo. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Omulimi ategana ennyo y’asaanira okufuna ku bibala ebibereberye. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Kale lowooza ku bye ŋŋamba; Mukama ajja kukuwa okutegeera byonna.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Jjukira nga Yesu Kristo ow’omu zzadde lya Dawudi yazuukira mu bafu ng’Enjiri gye ntegeeza bw’egamba. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Olw’Enjiri eyo, kyenva mbonaabona n’ensibibwa ng’omukozi w’ebibi. Naye ekigambo kya Katonda kyo tekisibiddwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Kyenva ngumira ebintu byonna olw’abalonde nabo balyoke balokolebwe era bafune, n’ekitiibwa ekitaggwaawo ekiri mu Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="2TI 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Ekigambo kino kyesigwa ekigamba nti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Obanga twafiira wamu naye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">era tulibeera balamu wamu naye.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Obanga tugumiikiriza awamu naye, era tulifugira wamu naye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">Obanga tumwegaana era naye alitwegaana.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Ffe bwe tutaba beesigwa, ye aba mwesigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">kubanga teyeewakanya.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukozi Katonda gw’Asiima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Ebyo bijjukizenga abantu ng’obakuutirira mu maaso ga Katonda, beewalenga okuwakana okutalina mugaso, nga bakyamya abo abawuliriza. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Fubanga okweraga ng’osiimibwa Katonda, ng’oli mukozi akola ebitakuswaza, era nga weekuumira mu kkubo ery’obubaka obw’amazima. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Weewalenga ebigambo ebinyooma era ebitaliimu nsa, kubanga abantu bibongera bwongezi mu butatya Katonda. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Era ebigambo byabwe birisaasaana nga kookolo; mu abo mwe muli Kumenayo ne Fireeto, <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>abaakyama ne bava ku mazima, nga bagamba nti okuzuukira kwabaawo dda, era waliwo abamu be bakyamizza. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Kyokka omusingi Katonda gwe yateekawo mugumu, era gulina akabonero kano: “Mukama amanyi ababe.” Era nti: “Buli ayatula erinnya lya Mukama ave mu butali butuukirivu.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Mu nnyumba ennene temubaamu bintu bya zaabu na ffeeza byokka, naye mubaamu n’eby’emiti, era n’eby’ebbumba. Ebimu bikozesebwa emirimu egy’ekitiibwa, n’ebirala egitali gya kitiibwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Noolwekyo buli eyeewala ebintu ebyo ebitali bya kitiibwa anaabanga ow’ekitiibwa, atukuziddwa, asaanira okukozesebwa mukama we, olw’omulimu omulungi.<verse eid="2TI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Naye ddukanga okwegomba okubi okw’ekivubuka, ogobererenga obutuukirivu, n’okukkiriza, n’okwagalana era n’emirembe awamu n’abo abasaba Mukama n’omutima omulongoofu. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Weewalenga empaka ez’obusirusiru, ezitaliimu magezi, kubanga omanyi nti zivaamu okulwana. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Omuddu wa Mukama tasaana kulwana, wabula okuba omukkakkamu eri bonna, n’okuba omuyigiriza omulungi agumiikiriza, <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>era aluŋŋamya n’obwetoowaze abo abamuwakanya, oboolyawo Katonda alibawa okwenenya, ne bamanya amazima, <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>ne bava mu mutego gwa Setaani gwe baguddemu abakozese by’ayagala, ne badda engulu mu kutegeera kwabwe.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ennaku ez’Oluvannyuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Naye tegeera kino nga mu nnaku ez’oluvannyuma walibaawo ebiseera ebizibu. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Kubanga abantu baliba nga beefaako bokka, nga balulunkanira ensimbi, nga beepanka, nga beekuluntaza, nga boogera ebibi, era nga tebawulira bazadde baabwe, nga tebeebaza, nga tebatya Katonda, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>nga tebaagalana era nga tebatabagana, nga bawaayiriza, nga tebeegendereza, nga bakambwe, nga tebaagala birungi, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>nga ba nkwe, nga baagala eby’amasanyu okusinga bwe baagala Katonda; <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>nga balina ekifaananyi eky’okutya Katonda so nga tebakkiriza maanyi gaakyo. Abantu ab’engeri eyo obeewalanga.<verse eid="2TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Mu abo mulimu abasensera mu mayumba ne bawamba abakazi abanafu mu mwoyo abazitoowereddwa ebibi, era abawalulwa okwegomba okubi okwa buli ngeri, <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>abayiga bulijjo, kyokka ne batatuuka ku kutegeerera ddala amazima, <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>nga Yane ne Yambere abaawakanya Musa, ne bano bwe batyo bawakanya amazima. Be bantu abaayonooneka ebirowoozo, abatakyalina kukkiriza kutuufu. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Kyokka tebaliiko gye balaga, kubanga obusirusiru bwabwe bujja kumanyibwa abantu bonna, ng’obwa abasajja abo bwe bwamanyibwa.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Naye ggwe wagoberera nnyo okuyigiriza kwange, n’empisa zange, ne kye nduubirira, n’okukkiriza kwange n’okubonaabona kwange n’okwagala kwange, n’okugumiikiriza kwange, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>n’okuyigganyizibwa n’okubonyaabonyezebwa ebyantukako mu Antiyokiya, ne mu Ikoniya ne mu Lisitula, okuyigganyizibwa kwe nayigganyizibwa, kyokka Mukama n’amponya mu byonna. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Era bonna abaagala okuba mu bulamu obutya Katonda mu Kristo Yesu, banaayigganyizibwanga. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Naye abakozi b’ebibi n’abalimba abeefuula okuba ekyo kye batali balyeyongera okuba ababi, ne babuzaabuza abalala, era nabo ne babula. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Kyokka ggwe nywereranga mu ebyo bye wayiga era n’obikkiririza ddala, ng’omanyi abaabikuyigiriza bwe bali. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Kubanga okuva mu buto bwo wamanya Ebyawandiikibwa Ebitukuvu ebiyinza okukufuula ow’amagezi, n’olokolebwa olw’okukkiriza Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Ebyawandiikibwa Ebitukuvu byonna, Katonda ye yabiruŋŋamya nga biwandiikibwa, era bigasa mu kuyigiriza, mu kunenya, mu kuluŋŋamya ne mu kubuuliranga omuntu abe omutuukirivu, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>omuntu wa Katonda alyoke abe ng’atuukiridde, ng’alina byonna ebyetaagibwa okukola buli mulimu omulungi.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Nkukuutirira mu maaso ga Katonda ne Kristo Yesu, anaatera okusalira abalamu n’abafu omusango, era n’olw’okujja kwe, n’olw’obwakabaka bwe, <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>buuliranga ekigambo kya Katonda, ng’oli mwetegefu mu kiseera ekituufu n’ekitali kituufu, ng’olaga ebikwekeddwa, ng’onenya, ng’ozaamu amaanyi, wakati mu kugumiikiriza, n’okubonaabona okungi, n’okuyigiriza. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Kubanga ekiseera kijja lwe baligaana okuwulira enjigiriza entuufu, era olw’okugoberera okwegomba kwabwe balyekuŋŋaanyiza abayigiriza, abalibayigiriza bye baagala, okuwulira. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Baligaana okuwuliriza eby’amazima, ne bagoberera enfumo obufumo. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Naye ggwe weefugenga mu bintu byonna, ogumirenga ebizibu, ng’okola omulimu ogw’omubuulizi w’enjiri, ng’otuukiririza ddala obuweereza bwo.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Nze kaakano mpebwayo, era ekiseera kyange eky’okuva ku nsi kituuse. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Nnwanye okulwana okulungi, mmalirizza olugendo lwange, nkuumye okukkiriza kwange. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Kye nsigazza kwe kufuna engule ey’obutuukirivu enterekeddwa, Mukama omulamuzi omutuukirivu gy’alimpeera ku lunaku luli. Taligiwa nze nzekka, naye aligiwa n’abo bonna abeegomba okujja kwe.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Fuba okujja amangu gye ndi. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Kubanga Dema yandekawo ng’ayagala omulembe gwa kaakano, n’agenda e Sessaloniika. Kulesuke yagenda Ggalatiya ne Tito n’agenda e Dalumatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Lukka yekka y’ali nange. Ggyayo Makko omuleete, kubanga annyamba nnyo mu buweereza. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Tukiko n’amutuma mu Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Bw’obanga ojja ondeeteranga omunagiro gwange gwe naleka e Tulowa ewa Kappo. Ondeeteranga n’emizingo gy’ebitabo, na ddala egyo egy’amaliba.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Alegezanda, omuweesi w’ebikomo yankola ebyettima bingi. Mukama alimusasula olw’ebikolwa bye. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Naawe mwekuume, kubanga yawakanya nnyo ebigambo byaffe. <verse eid="2TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Mu kuwoza kwange okwasooka, tewaali n’omu yajja kubeera nange, bonna banjabulira. Nsaba Katonda ekyo kireme kubavunaanibwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Kyokka Mukama waffe yabeera nange, n’ampa amaanyi, ne nsobola okutegeereza ddala Abaamawanga bonna Enjiri ne bagiwulira, bw’atyo n’anziggya mu kamwa k’empologoma. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Era Mukama anamponyanga mu buli kabi, era alintuusa mirembe mu bwakabaka bwe. Mukama agulumizibwenga emirembe n’emirembe. Amiina.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s1">Okulamusa n’Omukisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Nnamusiza Pulisika ne Akula n’ab’omu maka ga Onesifolo.<verse eid="2TI 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Erasuto yasigalayo mu Kkolinso, ate Tulofiimo namuleka mu Mireeto nga mulwadde. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Fuba ojje ng’ebiseera by’obutiti tebinnaba kutuuka.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TI 4:21"/>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ewubulo akulamusizza, ne Pudente, ne Lino, ne Kulawudiya, n’abooluganda bonna.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Mukama waffe abeerenga n’omwoyo gwo. Ekisa kibeerenga nammwe mwenna.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
